# A committed TEMPLATE of .github/c2-serving-job.env for the tp4/octo-2 four-card DEVELOPMENT window (scripts/ci/c2_serving_job.py parses it): copy it over
# .github/c2-serving-job.env on a throwaway commit of tp4/octo-2 and push a tag experiment/c2-serving-vN. Nothing here names a rig, a card, a host or a registry: the cards
# are resolved at run time. The jobs are templates only: no tag is pushed from this branch by its author. ORDER.txt has the order, the stop rules, the minutes and the read rules.
# ONE IMAGE FOR THE WHOLE WINDOW: C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-octo2-1 is a PLACEHOLDER for the tag B0 builds from the pushed branch head (sed -i 's/tp4-octo2-1/<tag>/' *.env). A commit of a file the image
# carries needs a new B0 build and a new tag in every template. The cards are under development: this window never stops, starts or hands back the node agent.
# OC1 (CONTROL, A1 of the ABAB): c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-ship-prefix-levern-octo, QWEN_FAST_OCTO=alternate, audits OFF - the profile every lever below is the parent of (it is the octo pack's O3). Four tests (warmup, the steady eight-user shape, eight 4k code
# users, eight 32k code users: 25 requests, no audit). Octo and m3 rounds are timed in PAIRS on this one boot; its m3 rounds are the control of the control for every lever (a lever that touches only the octo shape leaves
# the m3 rate where it was). RECORD the smoke log, the container log and the load average: every arm below is read against them (octo2_report.py --control, octo_compare.py --control). READ: c2_smoke_check clean (its octo rule: the admission once, at least 16 octo rounds at rows=8 and at least 16 counted rounds of each shape, strictly alternating, no program compiled on a switch) and NO stall. Check the load average around the run (a busy host skews host phases 10 to 20 percent); the rig's CI runner sets stay scaled to zero for the whole timed block. Duration (estimate): 55 minutes.
C2_CARDS=quad
C2_ACTIONS=reset smoke
C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-octo2-1
C2_PROFILE=c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-ship-prefix-levern-octo
C2_SMOKE_TESTS=warmup,concurrent8_steady,concurrent8_code_equal,concurrent8_code_32k
